WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.213
A useful oral description includes specific details: who, what, where, when and how.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:10.879
What makes a spoken description useful? Answer: Specific details about what happened

00:00:10.879 --> 00:00:11.687
and where.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:17.141
Describe a recent school event with its date, place and two important details.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:21.278
Discuss why: Details help the listener imagine events.
